<main class="zd-about-page">

  <section class="zd-about-hero">
    <p class="zd-about-eyebrow">About</p>

    <h1>Ziyu Development builds tools for intentional living.</h1>

    <p>
      A founder-led ecosystem of apps, products, writing, and community created to help
      people focus, grow, read better, block distractions, and build better lives.
    </p>

    <div class="zd-about-actions">
      <a href="/pages/projects" class="zd-about-btn zd-about-btn--primary">Explore Projects</a>
      <a href="/pages/founder-journey" class="zd-about-btn zd-about-btn--secondary">Founder Journey</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-about-split">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-about-eyebrow">Mission</p>
      <h2>Technology should help people become better, not just consume more.</h2>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p>
        Ziyu Development exists to build thoughtful software and physical products
        that support real life. The goal is not to keep people endlessly scrolling.
        The goal is to help people act, reflect, learn, focus, and grow.
      </p>

      <p>
        Every project is connected to the same larger mission: making tools that
        respect attention and support meaningful progress.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-about-values">
    <p class="zd-about-eyebrow">What we build around</p>
    <h2>The ecosystem is built on four ideas.</h2>

    <div class="zd-about-value-grid">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Focus</h3>
        <p>Protect attention from noise and distraction.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Growth</h3>
        <p>Make goals, habits, and progress easier to see and continue.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Learning</h3>
        <p>Help people find better books, ideas, and information.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Life</h3>
        <p>Design tools that serve real life instead of replacing it.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-about-projects">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-about-eyebrow">Projects</p>
      <h2>One mission, multiple tools.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-about-project-list">
      <a href="/pages/goal-grower">
        <strong>Goal Grower</strong>
        <span>Goals, habits, plants, and accountability.</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/myjourney">
        <strong>MyJourney</strong>
        <span>Planning, reflection, and life direction.</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/blokkr">
        <strong>Blokkr</strong>
        <span>Distraction blocking and focus protection.</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/kindlitt">
        <strong>Kindlitt</strong>
        <span>Clean books and better information discovery.</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-about-cta">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-about-eyebrow">Support the mission</p>
      <h2>Help turn the ecosystem into real products.</h2>
      <p>
        Support helps fund design, development, testing, content, product creation,
        and the time needed to build thoughtful technology.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/support" class="zd-about-btn zd-about-btn--light">Support the Mission</a>
  </section>

</main>

